        "text": "R.endpointLog T κ w₁ w₂ C η = Real.log (C*(Real.sqrt 220*R.physicalF T κ w₁ w₂ (110,η))); identifies endpointLog with the paper's ℓ_i = log(C E(X_i,η)), since CE = √(2X)ϕ and X_i = 110"
